   "tail": 1.2,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Honey Bunny Kidz presents: Honey's Pumpkin Patch Party!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.3
    },
    {
     "id": "mama",
     "x": 0.62
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "It was a cool, sunny autumn day. Crunchy leaves were falling, red, orange and yellow."
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Honey Bunny and Mama Bunny walked to the pumpkin patch together."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Look, Mama! So many pumpkins! Hello, friends! What color are the pumpkins?",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Orange! Yes! Bright orange pumpkins!"
    },
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "Today is our pumpkin party. Let's invite all our friends!"
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Hooray! A pumpkin party!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.2
    },
    {
     "id": "dotty",
     "x": 0.42
    },
    {
     "id": "mimi",
     "x": 0.66
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.86,
     "scale": 1.8
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Here come Dotty Duckling and Mimi Kitten!"
    },
    {
     "who": "dotty",
     "text": "Quack quack! Hello, Honey!"
    },
    {
     "who": "mimi",
     "text": "Meow! Can we pick pumpkins too?"
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Yes! Everyone can pick one pumpkin."
    },
    {
     "who": "mimi",
     "text": "I like this big one! Look how big it is!"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Mimi found a big, round pumpkin."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "dotty",
     "x": 0.35
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.5,
     "scale": 0.6
    },
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.7
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "dotty",
     "text": "And I like this tiny one. It is just my size! Quack!"
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Mimi's pumpkin is big. Dotty's pumpkin is small."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Can you find the small pumpkin? Point to it!",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "There it is! The little pumpkin, next to Dotty. Well done!"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Big or small, every pumpkin is special."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.2,
     "scale": 1.6
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.35,
     "scale": 1.6
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.5,
     "scale": 1.6
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.65,
     "scale": 1.6
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.8,
     "scale": 1.6
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "The friends put their pumpkins in a row. Let's count them together!",
     "pause": 0.9
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "One.",
     "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Two.",
     "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Three.",
     "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Four.",
     "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Five!",
     "pause": 0.9
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "How many pumpkins are there?",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Five pumpkins! Great counting!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.22
    },
    {
     "id": "mimi",
     "x": 0.42
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkinpip",
     "x": 0.72
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Then, something funny happened. A big pumpkin started to walk!"
    },
    {
     "who": "mimi",
     "text": "Oh! A walking pumpkin!"
    },
    {
     "who": "pumpkinpip",
     "text": "Hello, friends! Happy pumpkin party!"
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Who is in the pumpkin costume? Look! A waggy tail, and little paws."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Who has a waggy tail? Can you guess?",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "pumpkinpip",
     "text": "Woof woof!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.25
    },
    {
     "id": "pip",
     "x": 0.5
    },
    {
     "id": "mimi",
     "x": 0.75
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "It was Pip Puppy! He took off his costume with a big smile."
    },
    {
     "who": "pip",
     "text": "Surprise! It's me, Pip! I am a pumpkin puppy!"
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Pip! What a fun costume! You made us giggle!"
    },
    {
     "who": "mimi",
     "text": "Hee hee! You are the best pumpkin, Pip!"
    },
    {
     "who": "pip",
     "text": "But oh! I was in my costume. I did not pick a pumpkin."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "That's okay, Pip. I picked two pumpkins. You can have one of mine!"
    },
    {
     "who": "pip",
     "text": "Thank you, Honey! Sharing is so kind. Woof!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "mama",
     "x": 0.25
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin",
     "x": 0.5,
     "scale": 1.4
    },
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.72
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Now it was time to make pumpkin faces."
    },
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "Cutting pumpkins is a grown-up job. I will do the cutting. You can tell me what face to make."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Should we make a happy face, or a sleepy face? What do you think?",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "A happy, smiley face! Yes!"
    },
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "Two triangle eyes, and a big smile. Here we go!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "pumpkin_patch",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.15
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin_smile",
     "x": 0.33,
     "scale": 1.5
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin_smile",
     "x": 0.5,
     "scale": 2.0
    },
    {
     "id": "pumpkin_smile",
     "x": 0.67,
     "scale": 1.5
    },
    {
     "id": "pip",
     "x": 0.86
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Ta-da! The pumpkins have smiley faces!"
    },
    {
     "who": "pip",
     "text": "They are smiling at us! Woof!"
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "What shape are the pumpkin eyes? Can you say it?",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "honey",
     "text": "Triangles! Triangle eyes!"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Everyone smiled back at the happy pumpkins."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "sunset",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey",
     "x": 0.14
    },
    {
     "id": "dotty",
     "x": 0.3
    },
